<%# locals: (batch:, cards:, rows: fill_rows(cards)) %>
<%# How full each attribute is: what the sellers gave against what the system filled in. Counted over the cards on the page.
    The two bars differ in height as well as in colour, so they read apart in grey, in print and in high contrast. %>
<% total = fill_total(rows) %>

<section class="panel panel-pad mt-6" aria-labelledby="fill-title">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-4 gap-y-1">
    <h2 id="fill-title" class="section-title">Before → after</h2>
    <p class="text-xs text-muted">
      <% if batch.cards_count > cards.size %>for the first <%= num(cards.size) %> cards of <%= num(batch.cards_count) %><% else %>for all cards of the file<% end %>
    </p>
  </div>
  <p class="mt-1 max-w-3xl text-sm text-muted">
    The share of cards with the attribute filled: by the seller and after the system (accepted values only; disputed ones count once a person confirms them).
    Where the system added the most comes first; "+77" is how many percentage points the share grew.
  </p>

  <p class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-1.5 text-xs text-muted" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="fill-swatch fill-before inline-block h-1.5 w-5 rounded-full bg-zinc-600"></span>given by the seller</span>
    <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="fill-swatch inline-block h-3 w-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>after the system</span>
  </p>

  <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-3.5 text-sm">
    <% [ total, *rows ].compact.each_with_index do |row, index| %>
      <li class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1.5 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,13rem)_minmax(0,1fr)_9rem] <%= "border-b border-line pb-3.5 font-semibold" if index.zero? && total %>">
        <span class="min-w-0 break-words sm:line-clamp-2"><%= row.title %><span class="sr-only">: seller <%= row.before.round %>%, after the system <%= row.after.round %>%, <%= fill_gain(row) %></span></span>
        <span class="text-right whitespace-nowrap tabular-nums sm:col-start-3 sm:row-start-1" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="text-muted"><%= row.before.round %>%</span> → <span class="font-semibold"><%= row.after.round %>%</span>
          <span class="ml-1 inline-block min-w-9 font-semibold <%= row.gain.positive? ? "text-emerald-700" : "text-muted" %>"><%= fill_gain(row) %></span>
        </span>
        <div class="meter relative col-span-2 h-3 rounded-full bg-surface sm:col-span-1 sm:col-start-2 sm:row-start-1" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 rounded-full bg-emerald-500" style="width: <%= row.after.round(1) %>%"></div>
          <div class="fill-before absolute inset-y-[3px] left-0 rounded-full bg-zinc-600" style="width: <%= row.before.round(1) %>%"></div>
        </div>
      </li>
    <% end %>
  </ul>
</section>
